---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About Galápagos & Beyond: Ecuador-Based Travel Specialists"
  description="Galápagos & Beyond runs cruises, island tours and stays from Puerto Ayora, Santa Cruz, with comfort and adventure planned locally."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1>Comfort and adventure, planned locally</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Galápagos & Beyond is based in Puerto Ayora, Santa Cruz, the heart
        of the islands. We run small-ship cruises, guided island tours, and
        our own stays, so every part of your trip is arranged by people who
        live here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-mission">
    <div class="container mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
        <p>
          Galápagos & Beyond is a tour company dedicated to providing our
          customers with customized and flexible organized diving and land
          tours. We value every customer: our goal is to make dreams come
          true through a safe experience, education, and the preservation of
          this vulnerable environment and its unique animals.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our vision</p>
        <p>
          To be a leading force in increasing awareness of the importance of
          the islands and their value to humanity. We strive to inspire
          visitors and the community through education and the highest
          regard for the environment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-body">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <p>
          We book small-ship Galápagos cruises across Luxury, First Class
          and Tourist Superior tiers, run guided day tours and multi-day
          land packages to the islands, and operate our own places to
          stay (an aparthotel in Santa Cruz and condos in Quito), with
          pools, jacuzzis and saunas for guests arriving before or after
          their island trip.
        </p>
        <p>
          From guided snorkeling and biking to island-hopping itineraries,
          we design each trip to connect travelers to the islands directly,
          rather than through a generic booking engine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Recognized locally</h2>
        <p>
          Our Santa Cruz property has been recognized by Booking.com as one
          of the best-rated hotels in Galápagos, Santa Cruz: a reflection
          of the same hands-on service we bring to every cruise and tour we
          arrange.
        </p>
        <h2>Where we are</h2>
        <p>
          Puerto Ayora, Santa Cruz Island, Galápagos, with condos also
          available in Quito for mainland stays before or after your trip.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to plan your trip?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what you're looking for and we'll help you choose.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Start planning</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 1.5rem;
    background: var(--sand);
  }

  .about-hero .eyebrow {
    color: var(--brand-deep);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .about-mission {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .mission-card {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--white);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .mission-card .eyebrow {
    color: var(--brand-deep);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .mission-card p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .about-grid h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .about-grid h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about-grid p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-cta {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--white);
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-cta h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
  }

  .about-cta p {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
  }

  .about-cta .btn {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-grid,
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
